          Paste a public TikTok video link at the top of this page, choose a batch size, and export. The CSV
          opens cleanly in Excel, Numbers, and Google Sheets, with no account and no setup.
        </p>
        <a class="tp-btn" href="#tc-hero-headline">Export TikTok comments to CSV</a>
